# Files tracked here because they belong in the repository, and served by
# default because Vercel deploys the whole tree. These are not site content
# and a visitor reaching them learns something about the operator rather
# than about the project.
#
# DMARC_SETUP.md is the sharpest of them: it is an internal DNS runbook and
# it advertises p=none, which tells anyone reading that mail claiming to be
# from this domain is not being rejected yet. The record itself is public in
# DNS; the operational note about it does not have to be.
DMARC_SETUP.md
README.md
scripts/
favicon-backup.png
images/favicon.svg.old
